      "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story.\nGenerate ONE original square 3x3 image atlas, nine distinct scenes or object cards in exactly equal squares with a thin unobtrusive cream grid at one third and two thirds. Simple hand-cut paper gouache illustrations, crisp silhouettes and subtle paper texture, warm forest puppet theatre. Kids need to recognize each item on a tiny picture card. Keep subjects inside each cell with wide margins, uniform pale paper behind objects. No writing or typography.\nTop row, left to right: a small warm red toy drum with pale drum head and two clearly visible drumsticks; a diamond-shaped sage and sky-blue paper kite with a long tail and three simple ribbon ties; a brass handbell with dark persimmon handle.\nMiddle row: one clearly recognizable folded blue scarf with three large cream star patterns, draped diagonally; a muted warm brown soft cap with an obvious brim; a simple small green wooden toy cart with two large dark round wheels, open shallow cargo tray and red handle, seen from the side. Make the entire cart compact, friendly, distinct from the hat and bell.\nBottom row: the same green toy cart from a slight diagonal and its red handle, no extra character or cargo; a broad empty stage background with muted pale moss floor and soft tree silhouettes along the outer edges, no obstacles, no props; an original woodland puppet theatre small stage with sage curtain, four puppets across the stage: a broad chocolate-brown bear in a forest-green vest, a tawny mother bear in a rust-orange apron with leaf brooch, a little honey-brown bear in a teal striped shirt, a girl with golden-yellow bob wearing a coral pinafore over cream shirt. No additional puppets or letters.\nNo book cover, reference images, letters, numbers, borders within cells, busy scenes or watermarks.",
